%% L5 — Tooling and Integration: tool invocation through CubeSandbox
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent (L3)
    participant R as mcp-sandbox-runner
    participant REG as mcp-registry
    participant RD as Redis (idempotency)
    participant CM as CubeMaster
    participant CL as Cubelet on KVM node
    participant VM as Sandbox microVM
    participant VS as CubeVS (eBPF egress policy)
    participant L4 as memory-svc (L4)
    participant L7 as OTel Collector (L7)

    A->>R: POST /tools/invoke (tool_id, input, deadline, idem_key)
    R->>RD: lookup idempotency_key
    alt cached result
        RD-->>R: cached result
        R-->>A: 200 (X-Idempotent=HIT)
        R->>L7: span tool.invoke (cache_hit=true)
    end

    R->>REG: GET /manifests/{tool_id}@{version}
    REG-->>R: manifest (schema, resource budget, egress policy)
    R->>R: validate input against schema
    R->>R: check workload tool allowlist (Agent CRD)
    alt validation fails
        R-->>A: 400 (validation error)
        R->>L7: span tool.invoke (status=400)
    end

    R->>CM: createSandbox (E2B-compatible, template=tool)
    CM->>CL: schedule on KVM node
    CL->>VM: launch microVM (RustVMM, <60ms cold start)
    VM-->>CM: ready
    CM-->>R: sandbox_id, exec_endpoint

    R->>VS: apply egress policy from manifest
    R->>VM: exec (via E2B SDK)
    Note over VM: runs with CPU/mem limits;<br/>deadline enforced by runner
    VM-->>R: output (stdout, stderr, files, exit)

    R->>L4: persist artifacts as memory handles (if any)
    R->>CM: reapSandbox
    R->>RD: store (idem_key, result_hash) TTL=deadline
    R-->>A: 200 result envelope
    R->>L7: span tool.invoke (gen_ai-extension attrs: tool_id, duration, exit_code)
    R->>L7: audit event audit.tool.{tool_id} (input_hash, output_hash)
